Timestral Axon / MLX inference port

Based on Timestral by Mistral AI:
https://github.com/mistralai/timestral
Pinned source: a534bdbd244d64f3d9d743f46c7bf6fc330ed4ff

The upstream configuration and categorical encoding are retained; normalization,
masks, forecasting and model orchestration are adapted to NumPy. The learned
network is expressed in Axon and generated for MLX.
